<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Celulosa Q1 net loss $28.29 million.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Celulosa Q1 net loss $28.29 million.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended August 31.</p>
<p>Net loss $28.29 million vs loss $9.06 million.</p>
<p>Fiscal year ended May 31 net loss $345 million vs loss $196 million.</p>
<p>Note: The company said international demand for newsprint and cellulose picked up in the quarter, but even so price rises have been delayed.</p>
<p>At the end of the quarter though, the company started to negotiate some export orders at higher prices.</p>
<p>Full company name is Celulosa Argentina SA.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
